{
  "$comment": [
    "Proposed nl additions for src/data/claims-lint.json (patterns.nl per rule) and src/data/keyword-map.json (seOwned.nl, seOwnedLead.nl, reserved.G1.nl). Drafted with the M3 nl copy (docs/redesign-2026/ops/m3/nl-qa.md); not merged — the lead merges.",
    "Every claims-lint rule with per-locale patterns is covered (io-home and engine-claim only have '*'); no rule had an nl key yet. Tested in a private copy: 0 hits on src/locales/nl.json (rule only / exempt / exemptPrefix applied as the validator does), each counter-example sentence in the QA record is caught.",
    "Matching is case-insensitive with the u flag. Lookbehind / lookahead on \\p{L} replace \\b where a word may start or end with a non-ASCII letter, and keep 'nieuw' (new) from matching 'nieuws' (news).",
    "seOwned.nl keeps the existing 'Engels leren'. reserved.G1.nl: the Dutch how-to markers ('hoe', 'zo … je', keeping the original) for the home title, H1, description and #cta H2 (doc 03 §1.6 M2)."
  ],
